                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The Clerk Lunch",
                                  "A tin beside the\nclerk contains two\nspoons, although\nshe works",
                                  "alone. She says\none is for\nvisitors who bring\na hard problem\nnear",
                                  "lunchtime. The\nsoup is ordinary\npotato. The extra\nspoon has probably",
                                  "saved more\narguments than the\nstamp collection."
                                ],
